    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but \"just existing\" is the worst part. every time i close my eyes i just see the headlines, the comments, the way my career just evaporated overnight. there's no \"quiet space\" when everyone knows what you are. it's like the world has already decided my role is over. it's just a long, slow, miserable decline into nothingness. i'm just waiting for the rest of my life to catch up to the fact that i'm already finished.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
